    <briefdescription>
<para>This structure contains the parameters used by the AI Vision Sensor to define a color. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>hue_range and saturation_range are ranges for hue and saturation that are acceptable. For example, if a large hue range is specified for a blue color, colors that are more magenta or teal may be detected as &quot;blue&quot;. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
